  "body": "## Summary\n- add Helm render modes for Glimmung warm/hot test-slot installs\n- keep production rendering unchanged while making slot namespaces, hostnames, and resource names configurable\n- render warm slot prerequisites separately from hot runtime workloads\n\n## Validation\n- `helm lint k8s`\n- `helm template kill-me k8s --namespace kill-me`\n- `helm template kill-me-slot-1-warm k8s --namespace kill-me-slot-1 --set renderMode=warm --set testEnv.slotName=kill-me-slot-1 --set hostname=kill-me-slot-1.kill-me.dev.romaine.life`\n- `helm template kill-me-slot-1-hot k8s --namespace kill-me-slot-1 --set renderMode=hot --set testEnv.slotName=kill-me-slot-1 --set hostname=kill-me-slot-1.kill-me.dev.romaine.life`\n- `kubectl diff -f /tmp/kill-me-normal.yaml` (empty)\n- `kubectl apply --dry-run=server -f /tmp/kill-me-normal.yaml`\n- `kubectl apply --dry-run=client -f /tmp/kill-me-warm.yaml`\n- `kubectl apply --dry-run=client -f /tmp/kill-me-hot.yaml`",
  "changed_files": 12,
